-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party code, services and content
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

All Set contains no third-party source code. It uses the following services
and content at run time; each keeps its own licence and terms.

- Open-Meteo (open-meteo.com): weather forecast, geocoding and air quality data.
  Data licensed CC BY 4.0. Attribution: "Weather data by Open-Meteo.com".
- Openverse (openverse.org): image search. Each image carries its own licence,
  shown next to the image with its creator. All Set only offers images whose
  licence allows commercial use (CC0, Public Domain Mark, CC BY, CC BY-SA).
- Picsum Photos (picsum.photos): photos from Unsplash, under the Unsplash
  License (unsplash.com/license). Credited where shown.
- GitHub (api.github.com, github.com): a user's public contribution data, only
  when they enter a GitHub user name in a widget.
- Anthropic and OpenAI APIs: only when the user adds their own API key to the
  AI Screenshot feature; screenshots are sent to the provider the user picks.
- Sparkle (sparkle-project.org), MIT License, if and when the updater is
  enabled. Its licence text is in Contents/Resources/Notices.
